- Use scikit-learn for consistent machine learning workflow and model development.
- Follow proper data preprocessing with transformers and pipelines.
- Implement cross-validation for robust model evaluation and selection.
- Use proper train/validation/test splits to avoid data leakage.
- Apply feature scaling and normalization appropriately for different algorithms.
- Use pipelines to ensure consistent preprocessing in training and inference.
- Handle categorical variables with proper encoding techniques.
- Implement proper hyperparameter tuning with GridSearchCV or RandomizedSearchCV.
- Use appropriate evaluation metrics for different types of machine learning problems.
- Save and load models properly with joblib or pickle for deployment.

